Adoption and transference.</b>&nbsp; Pursuant to the requirement of King County
Charter Section 880, there is adopted Title 21A of the "King County
code" as compiled by the King County council.&nbsp; K.C.C. Chapter 21A.61A of
the code is hereby transferred to Title 27.&nbsp; K.C.C. Sections 21A.61.060, .070
are hereby transferred to Title 20.&nbsp; (Ord. 10870 § 1, 1993).</span></p>

