  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Apply zoning
  closest to Comprehensive Plan land use designations</span></p>
  </td>
 </tr>
 <tr>
  <td width="144" valign="top" style="width:107.8pt;border-top:none;border-left:
  double windowtext 2.25pt;border-bottom:none;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
