  border-bottom:double windowtext 2.25pt;border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
  padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt">
  <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">CB or RB</span></p>
